        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-08-23T01:05:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"MigrantP\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/48/1921_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MigrantP:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>ISLAND OF SPIRITS[ SHENANIGAN ]At the end of the environment turn, play a game of Spirit Island.If the spirits win, each hero target regains 2 HP. If the invaders win, each hero target deals itself 2 irreducible psychic damage.At the start of the environment turn, destroy this card.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I can’t wait for the card that searches a deck for a SHENANIGAN.</p>",
