        "created_at": "2017-08-29T18:40:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was happy with them being sperate. No need to shoe horn Spirit Island into Sentinels Comic. I love the Spirit island Lore as it is. But I am happy we might get Akash of some kind.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
